                "url": "https://github.com/Elchi3"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/286386?u=bc4894b945491e0834d2306dade7fef748ddf698&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h4 dir=\"auto\">Summary</h4>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Added firefox support for text autospace</li>\n<li>Added note about what is actually supported</li>\n<li>Added flag</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Test results and supporting details</h4>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Tested in Firefox Nightly 144.0a1 (2025-08-25) parses but no effect</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Related issues</h4>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Content PR - coming soon</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/mdn/data/pull/1005\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/data/pull/1005/hovercard\">Data PR</a></li>\n<li>Firefox Release Note PR - coming soon</li>\n</ul>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/27670",
